{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,-1],[1000016,0],[1000017,400],[1000018,50000],[1000019,0],[1000020,0],[1000021,4],[1000022,98000004],[1000023,0],[1000024,289],[1000025,-1],[1000026,-1],[1000027,-1],[1000028,-1],[1000029,289],[1000030,-1],[1000031,-1],[1000032,-1],[1000033,-1],[1000034,289],[1000035,-1],[1000036,-1],[1000037,-1],[1000038,-1],[1000039,289],[1000040,-1],[1000041,-1],[1000042,-1],[1000043,-1],[1000044,289],[1000045,-1],[1000046,-1],[1000047,-1],[1000048,-1],[1000049,289],[1000050,-1],[1000051,-1],[1000052,-1],[1000053,-1],[1000054,289],[1000055,-1],[1000056,-1],[1000057,-1],[1000058,-1],[1000059,289],[1000060,-1],[1000061,-1],[1000062,-1],[1000063,-1],[1000064,289],[1000065,-1],[1000066,-1],[1000067,-1],[1000068,-1],[1000069,289],[1000070,-1],[1000071,-1],[1000072,-1],[1000073,-1],[1000074,289],[1000075,-1],[1000076,-1],[1000077,-1],[1000078,-1],[1000079,289],[1000080,-1],[1000081,-1],[1000082,-1],[1000083,-1],[1000084,0],[1000085,0],[1000086,1],[1000087,2],[1000088,3],[1000089,4],[1000090,5],[1000091,6],[1000092,7],[1000093,8],[1000094,9],[1000095,10],[1000096,11],[1000097,12],[1000098,13],[1000099,14],[1000100,15],[1000101,34],[1000102,35],[1000103,36],[1000104,77],[1000105,78],[1000106,33],[1000107,27],[1000108,28],[1000109,38],[1000110,39],[1000111,3],[1000112,25],[1000113,26],[1000114,30],[1000115,37],[1000116,10],[1000117,40],[1000118,41],[1000119,42],[1000120,43],[1000121,53],[1000122,80],[1000123,51],[1000124,24],[1000125,64]],"messages":{"1000000":"Ento Village\n","1000001":"Ento Village\n","1000002":"...\n","1000003":"Welcome.\n","1000004":"This is Ento Village, a village of demons.\nThe power of Hiperion has transformed us into demons.\n","1000005":"The power of Hiperion increases steadily\nand it's getting tough to hang on to the last\nvestiges of our humanity...\n","1000006":"For some reason the magic hasn't affected you,\nso I would like to ask you one thing.\n","1000007":"Can you reclaim the Ruins of Exorcism from the demons? The Ruins of\nExorcism are located on Orphe Beach. You can get to Orphe Beach\nthrough the Forest of Devils, west of this village.\n","1000008":"You're our only chance.\n","1000009":"I'm counting on you.\n","1000010":"I appreciate your help.\nThis is a reward.\n","1000011":"Lately, the magic has been getting stronger.\nI have a bad feeling in my gut.\n","1000012":"You can keep the form of a human\nafter the power of Hiperion has affected you.\nYou must have magical abilities to accomplish that feat.\n","1000013":"...\n","1000014":"So, Altecia gave you...\n","1000015":"Did you say the Devil Dignosis?\n","1000016":"Somebody said that the Devil's Castle was on the west end of\nHiperion. We're not sure because\nwe've never gone that far into Hiperion.\n","1000017":"The evil creatures around here\nhave special demonic powers.\nKeep an eye out.\n","1000018":"Keep an eye out.\n","1000019":"Was the gate of the Devil's Castle closed?\nIf so, we cannot do anything.\nBut, you could make your way in somehow!\n","1000020":"Oh, yes.\nI've heard that the Devil Dignosis\nhas a right-hand man named Goliate.\n","1000021":"His mansion should be somewhere in Hiperion.\n","1000022":"It might be related to\nfinding Dignosis.\n","1000023":"Hmm...\n","1000024":"You... you defeated Goliate as well?!\n","1000025":"Amazing!\n","1000026":"...\n","1000027":"I don't know why you're heading for\nthe Devil's Castle...\n","1000028":"If his power continues to grow,\nit will affect not only Hiperion, but\nother areas too.\n","1000029":"We cannot return to other lands anymore.\nAll of us fear that\nwe are too evil now.\n","1000030":"If only you had the power\nto defeat Dignosis...\n","1000031":"Would you battle Dignosis in the hopes\nthat you will prevent more from becoming like us?\n","1000032":"Please.\n","1000033":"Please.\n","1000034":"Thank you.\nIt is too late for us to fully recover,\nbut the demonic power should be contained.\n","1000035":"This is just a small reward,\nbut you may now use the Giant Warehouse VIII.\n","1000036":"I really appreciate your help.\n","1000037":"So, do you want to buy something or not?\n \u30fb~Buy Armaments         ~\n \u30fb~Buy Equipment         ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                                 ~QUIT~\n","1000038":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000039":"Not enough money.\n","1000040":"Everything seems perfect.\n","1000041":"To identify your item, it costs %d in Gold.  OK?\n \n                                  ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000042":"You don't have anything that is not already known.\n","1000043":"I'm Giraa.\nI'm doing business in this village for some reason or another.\n","1000044":"I just wanted to start a business here, I guess.\n","1000045":"Without notice, something hit me and\nI morphed into this ugly shape.\n","1000046":"Anyways, please buy something.\n","1000047":"(Growl)\n","1000048":"I've got good things.\n","1000049":"(Growl)\n","1000050":"(Roar)\n","1000051":"This is Ento Village.\nHuman beings have fallen to a demonic power...\n","1000052":"In short, a village of demons.\n","1000053":"I was so sick that I didn't expect to live much longer than a year.\nSo I moved to Hiperion to try to extend my life a little but...\n","1000054":"I'm full of regret.\n","1000055":"I may not look it, but I used to be a knight.\nI was interested in solving the mysteries of Hiperion and came here.\nLook at me now... I'm evil.\n","1000056":"My memories of human life are slipping away with each passing day.\nI'm not sure when I will totally lose my ability to reason.\n","1000057":"I was bullied when I was a child, so\nI wanted to grow strong enough to prevent\nanyone from being able to push me around again.\n","1000058":"I found that power here, but now\nI've lost something more important.\n","1000059":"If you go far west of here,\nyou'll reach the ruins where someone told me the Devil lives.\n","1000060":"Be careful.\nThe evils of Hiperion are atrocious.\n","1000061":"This Enemy Hole must be a transportation system.\nA while ago, I saw demons disappear into it.\n","1000062":"I wonder why nothing happens when I get onto it?\n","1000063":"I've heard that there is a forest with demons\nthat the Noils once caught and kept there.\n","1000064":"You shouldn't go there because it's a demon nest\nthat the Noils couldn't keep under control.\n","1000065":"Somebody said that a wizard living in Antalusia\nwas searching for some ruins.\n","1000066":"The Ruins of Remoteness, I think.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,3,10000002,4],[0,5,4294967295,6],[0,3,10000003,10],[0,3,10000004,11],[0,3,10000005,12],[0,0,10000300,13],[0,0,12000000,14],[0,1,12000000,29],[0,0,12000001,46],[0,1,12000001,51],[0,0,12000100,111],[0,1,12000100,114],[0,0,12000002,116],[0,1,12000002,119],[0,0,12000003,124],[0,1,12000003,127],[0,0,12000004,132],[0,1,12000004,135],[0,0,12000005,140],[0,1,12000005,143],[0,0,12000006,148],[0,1,12000006,151],[0,0,12000007,156],[0,1,12000007,159],[0,0,12000008,164],[0,1,12000008,167],[0,0,12000009,172],[0,1,12000009,175],[0,5,4294967295,180],[0,0,10000200,188],[0,0,10000100,189],[0,5,4294967295,194],[1,0,10020000,201],[1,0,10020001,207],[0,2,110020000,208],[1,0,10020002,211],[1,0,10020003,217],[0,2,110020002,218],[1,0,10020004,221],[1,0,10020005,227],[0,2,110020004,228],[1,0,10020006,231],[1,0,10020007,237],[0,2,110020006,238],[1,0,10020008,241],[1,0,10020009,247],[0,2,110020008,248],[1,0,10020010,251],[1,0,10020011,257],[0,2,110020010,258],[1,0,10020012,261],[1,0,10020013,267],[0,2,110020012,26